    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mana sphere, Protection sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you create a ward, you may also use your shuffle inside that ward’s area of effect. You may maintain concentration on this ward and shuffle with the same action. A shuffle created this way does not alter the effects of the ward created as part of the same action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mana#toc104\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
